WEBVTT

00:00:02.453 --> 00:00:05.373
- Show us the bolt!
- Get back, you oil-thirsty parasites!

00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:08.693
- Where's the old McQueen?
- Actually, this is my good side here.

00:00:08.973 --> 00:00:11.013
- Harv! Harv!
- Give us the bolt!

00:00:11.933 --> 00:00:12.933
- Harv?
- Come on!

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.733
- Kid, I'm over here!
- How you doin', buddy?

00:00:15.773 --> 00:00:18.453
My star client disappears
off the face of the earth!

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:20.733
- How do you think I'm doing?
- I can explain.

00:00:20.773 --> 00:00:25.213
I'm doing great! You're everywhere!
Radio, TV, the papers!

00:00:25.293 --> 00:00:28.333
You can't buy this kind of publicity!
What do you need me for?

00:00:28.413 --> 00:00:30.893
That's just a figure of speech,
by the way. You signed a contract.

00:00:30.973 --> 00:00:33.253
Where are you?
I can't even find you on my GPS.

00:00:33.293 --> 00:00:35.853
I'm in this little town
called Radiator Springs.

00:00:35.973 --> 00:00:39.133
- You know Route 66? It's still here!
- Yeah, that's great, kid.

00:00:39.173 --> 00:00:40.373
Playtime is over, pal.

00:00:40.493 --> 00:00:44.293
While the world's been trying to
find you Dinoco has had no one to woo.

00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:46.053
- Who are they gonna woo?
- Chick!

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:49.773
Bingo. In fact, check out
what's on the plasma right now.

00:00:49.813 --> 00:00:51.973
- Show us the thunder!
- You want thunder?

00:00:52.053 --> 00:00:55.693
You want thunder?
Ka-chicka, ka-chicka!

00:00:55.773 --> 00:00:59.053
- Hey, that's my bit!
- You've gotta get to Cali, pronto!

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:03.133
Just get out of Radiation Stinks now,
or Dinoco is history, you hear me?

00:01:03.173 --> 00:01:04.933
Just give me a second here, Harv.

00:01:05.093 --> 00:01:06.773
No, wait. Where are you goin'?

00:01:06.853 --> 00:01:10.133
Get in the trailer, baby. Kid!
You want a bigger trailer?

00:01:14.253 --> 00:01:17.053
Sally, I... I want you to...

00:01:17.693 --> 00:01:20.813
Look, I wish... [sighs]

00:01:22.253 --> 00:01:25.133
Thank you. Thanks for everything.

00:01:25.173 --> 00:01:27.253
[groans, chuckles]

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:32.533
- It was just a road.
- No. It was much more than that.

00:01:35.653 --> 00:01:38.853
Hey, kid! We gotta go.
Harv's goin' crazy!

00:01:38.893 --> 00:01:42.173
He's gonna have me fired if
I don't get you in the truck right now!

00:01:42.213 --> 00:01:44.973
- Mack, just... hold it for...
- You should go.

00:01:45.053 --> 00:01:47.253
- I know, but...
- Good luck in California.

00:01:49.613 --> 00:01:52.693
I hope you find
what you're looking for.

00:01:52.733 --> 00:01:54.853
- McQueen, come on!
- Sally...

00:01:54.893 --> 00:01:58.133
- Sally!
- Show us the bolt, McQueen! The bolt!

00:01:58.213 --> 00:02:00.293
Hey, Lightning, show us the bolt!

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.893
- Come on, get in the trailer.
- Where's the old McQueen?

00:02:08.973 --> 00:02:11.373
- The bolt!
- That's it. That's right, let's go!

00:02:11.413 --> 00:02:14.133
You're a big shining star.
You're a superstar.

00:02:14.213 --> 00:02:16.493
You don't belong there, anyway.

00:02:16.573 --> 00:02:19.573
Whoa... Wait...
Whoa, whoa, wait, wait!

00:02:20.053 --> 00:02:22.293
[engine starts]

00:02:22.373 --> 00:02:24.573
Hey, guys!
McQueen's leavin' in the truck!

00:02:31.733 --> 00:02:34.093
Hey, are you Doc Hudson?

00:02:34.173 --> 00:02:36.613
- Yeah.
- Thanks for the call.

00:02:45.053 --> 00:02:48.773
- You called them?
- It's best for everyone, Sally.

00:02:49.453 --> 00:02:52.573
Best for everyone or best for you?

00:03:09.053 --> 00:03:11.853
I didn't get to say goodbye to him.

00:03:57.453 --> 00:03:59.733
[light buzzing]

00:04:11.413 --> 00:04:14.733
[Bob] Hello, race fans. Welcome
to what has become, quite simply,

00:04:14.813 --> 00:04:17.093
the biggest event
in the history of racing.

00:04:17.173 --> 00:04:19.413
A three-way battle for the Piston Cup!

00:04:19.493 --> 00:04:21.933
[Darrell] There's a crowd
of nearly 200,000 cars

00:04:22.053 --> 00:04:24.573
here at the Los Angeles
International Speedway.

00:04:24.653 --> 00:04:29.013
Tickets to this race are hotter than a
black leather seat on a hot summer day!

00:04:29.053 --> 00:04:31.613
[Bob] The King, Chick Hicks
and Lightning McQueen

00:04:31.693 --> 00:04:35.053
in a 200 lap, winner-takes-all,
tiebreaker race.

00:04:35.093 --> 00:04:38.333
[Darrell] I got a lotta miles on me,
but let me tell you somethin'.

00:04:38.373 --> 00:04:42.373
I never thought I'd see anything
like this. This is exciting!

00:04:42.453 --> 00:04:44.813
[Bob] In fact, the country
has almost shut down

00:04:44.893 --> 00:04:48.973
to watch what many experts
are calling "the race of the century."

00:04:49.053 --> 00:04:51.693
Hey, King!
Good luck in your last race.

00:04:51.733 --> 00:04:55.853
- You've sure been an inspiration to me.
- Thanks, Junior. Appreciate it.

00:04:55.893 --> 00:04:59.013
- Hey, be careful out there, OK?
- Yeah, man.

00:04:59.053 --> 00:05:00.053
[Mia] He's hot!

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:02.813
Wanna know the forecast?
I'll give you the forecast.

00:05:02.893 --> 00:05:05.973
A 100 percent chance of thunder!
Ka-chicka! Ka-chicka!

00:05:06.093 --> 00:05:08.573
Say it with me!
Ka-chicka! Ka-chicka!

00:05:08.653 --> 00:05:11.573
Hey, you! No admittance
without a garage pass.

00:05:11.653 --> 00:05:14.413
Oh, it's OK.
Lightning McQueen knows me!

00:05:14.493 --> 00:05:17.613
Hey, Marco, it's a beautiful day
for a race, isn't it?

00:05:17.733 --> 00:05:22.693
- Absolutely, Mr. Andretti.
- And good morning to you, Fred.

00:05:22.773 --> 00:05:26.653
Mario Andretti knows my name!
You gotta let me in now!

00:05:26.733 --> 00:05:27.973
[guard] Sorry, pal.

00:05:28.053 --> 00:05:32.293
[Lightning] OK, here we go.
Focus. Speed.

00:05:33.093 --> 00:05:35.893
I am speed.

00:05:35.933 --> 00:05:37.573
[cars whizzing]

00:05:37.613 --> 00:05:38.813
Victory.

00:05:38.893 --> 00:05:41.013
One winner, two losers.

00:05:41.093 --> 00:05:43.053
[engine revving]

00:05:43.093 --> 00:05:48.653
Speed. Speed. Speed. Speed...

00:05:48.733 --> 00:05:51.293
[birds singing]

00:05:52.773 --> 00:05:53.773
[knock on door]

00:05:53.813 --> 00:05:55.453
[Mack] Lightnin'! You ready?

00:05:55.493 --> 00:05:58.213
[gasping] Yeah, yeah, yeah! I'm ready.

00:06:01.453 --> 00:06:04.453
[indistinct chatter]

00:06:11.573 --> 00:06:14.373
Mack, thanks for being
my pit crew today.

00:06:14.493 --> 00:06:17.053
Don't worry about it, kid.
It's the least I could do.

00:06:17.133 --> 00:06:19.533
After all, "Gas Can"
is my middle name.

00:06:19.613 --> 00:06:21.973
- It is?
- Ah... Not really.

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:29.333
[all shouting]

00:06:29.413 --> 00:06:31.173
[gulping]

00:06:39.253 --> 00:06:40.653
Uh-oh

00:06:44.693 --> 00:06:47.293
- [cheering, laughing]
- [giggling]

00:06:51.493 --> 00:06:54.533
Nelson! Zoom in.
Ready, 16? Take 16.

00:06:54.693 --> 00:06:56.893
[Bob] And there he is,
Lightning McQueen!

00:06:56.973 --> 00:07:00.093
Missing all week, and then he turns up
in the middle of nowhere!

00:07:00.173 --> 00:07:02.573
In a little town
called Radiator Springs.

00:07:02.653 --> 00:07:05.693
[Darrell] Wearin' whitewall tires,
of all things.

00:07:06.853 --> 00:07:09.973
- Oh!
- Ka-chicka! Ka-chicka! Ka-chicka!

00:07:10.053 --> 00:07:11.213
[chuckling]

00:07:11.293 --> 00:07:13.613
Hey, where you been?
I've been kinda lonely.

00:07:13.693 --> 00:07:16.573
Nobody to hang out with.
I mean, except the Dinoco folks.

00:07:16.653 --> 00:07:19.653
And the twins. Of course.
The ones that used to be your fans,

00:07:19.693 --> 00:07:22.893
but now they're my fans.
Listen to what the twins think...

